#: aboutwidget.cpp:38 main.cpp:91
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Pusat Kawalan KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:40
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan persekitaran kerja anda."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang ke \"Pusat Maklumat KDE\", tempat di mana anda boleh mencari "
"menyelaraskan persekitaran ruang kerja anda. Pilih item dari indeks di kiri anda untuk "
"memuatkan modul penyelarasan."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:48 main.cpp:95
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Pusat Maklumat KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information "
"about your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang ke \"Pusat Maklumat KDe\", tempat di mana anda boleh mencari "
"maklumat untuk sistem komputer anda."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a "
"particular configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Klik pada tab \"Bantuan\" pada bahagian kiri untuk melihat bantuan bagi modul kawalan "
"aktif. Guna tab \"Cari\" jika anda tidak pasti di mana letaknya pilihan untuk penyelarasan "
"yang ditentukan."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:62
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "Versi KDE:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:63
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Pengguna:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:64
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Nama hos:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:65
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sistem:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:66
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Keluaran:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:67
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Mesin:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:38 modules.cpp:153
msgid "<big>Loading...</big>"
msgstr "<big>Memuatkan...</big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:82 toplevel.cpp:338
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Tiada perubahan disimpan untuk modul aktif.\n"
"Anda mahu terapkan perubahan sebelum laksanakan modul baru atau abaikan perubahan?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:85 toplevel.cpp:341
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or "
"discard the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Tiada perubahan disimpan untuk modul aktif.\n"
"Anda mahu terapkan perubahan sebelum keluar dari Pusat Kawalan atau abaikan perubahan?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:88 toplevel.cpp:344
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Perubahan Tidak Disimpan"

#: helpwidget.cpp:57
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options.</"
"p><p>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Guna \"Apakah Ini\" (Shift+F1) untuk mendapatkan bantuan yang telah ditentukan.</"
"p><p>Untuk membaca keseluruhan manual, klik <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Info Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active info "
"module.<br><br>Click <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">here</a> to read "
"the general Info Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Pusat Maklumat KDE</h1>Tiada bantuan segera untuk modul kawalan aktif. "
"<br><br>Klik <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">di sini</a> untuk membaca manual umum "
"Pusat Maklumat."

#: helpwidget.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active "
"control module.<br><br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> to "
"read the general Control Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Pusat Kawalan KDE</h1>Tiada bantuan segera untuk modul kawalan aktif. "
"<br><br>Klik <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">di sini</a> untuk membaca manual umum "
"Pusat Kawalan."

